: false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87922002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049747016", "personaname": "ChrisHansenIRL", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Thradic/", "num_games_owned": 624, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 2927, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 295, "last_played": 1786241605, "avatar": "14f1a9927382fa8dea134a0f3ca6f17e6938e131"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun little aim trainer.", "timestamp_created": 1614989015, "timestamp_updated": 1659851324, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496575325727462769", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87869275", "author": {"steamid": "76561199122080804", "personaname": "Shade", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199122080804/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3609, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 364, "last_played": 1769219619, "avatar": "07c374a3cb98b92f404a95a6197bb4deb25a0b54"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very promising game with sooooo much potential, lacking in content and the same bosses and enemy units get a bit old. The base upgrades are fun but they don't take long to unlock. I would also like to see more differences in the \"Classes\" as right now only the side attack and ultimate sorta thing are different. On top of that just more classes in general, I love the amount of weapons and the point system they have as it allows you to make each run very unique. The level up perks are also pretty good but most of them are fairly basic in there effects. One of the best things about this game is the gun play as it feels amazing so if your worried about the combat being dull you don't have to worry. For random improvements I wont say much as I know they will be rolling out updates but I would love to see wall-run implemented not that the movement right now is bad I just love bein fast. Overall a very good game with the potential to be a fav of mine, I wait with much anticipation for the future of the game :)\n\nOh I also want a sword", "timestamp_created": 1614913451, "timestamp_updated": 1614913815, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87868443", "author": {"steamid": "76561198089653895", "personaname": "Sweepy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/executivesweepy/", "num_games_owned": 895, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 7179, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 21, "playtime_at_review": 148, "last_played": 1789852557, "avatar": "74975a67a92e3becbb80ceb3677aaccf2a21a633"}, "language": "english", "review": "Super fun gunplay with a variety of weapons. I really liked being able to choose a class and the OST is absolutely banging\n\nEdit: They added a wh40k bolter 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1614911980, "timestamp_updated": 1701051202, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}